{"content":[{"c":["HASSHUB"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["1. Merari clan leader of Levi’s tribe. Hasshub was the father of Shemaiah, a settler in Jerusalem after the return from captivity (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.9.14","r":"1Chr.9.14","rawR":"1Chr.9.14","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.9.14","value":"1Chr.9.14"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 9:14"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Neh.11.15","r":"Neh.11.15","rawR":"Neh.11.15","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Neh.11.15","value":"Neh.11.15"}],"t":"ref","v":"Neh 11:15"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["2. Pahath-moab’s son, who repaired a section of the Jerusalem wall and the Tower of the Ovens during the time of Nehemiah (",{"href":"?bref=Neh.3.11","r":"Neh.3.11","rawR":"Neh.3.11","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Neh.3.11","value":"Neh.3.11"}],"t":"ref","v":"Neh 3:11"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["3. Another Hasshub who repaired the Jerusalem wall opposite his house (",{"href":"?bref=Neh.3.23","r":"Neh.3.23","rawR":"Neh.3.23","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Neh.3.23","value":"Neh.3.23"}],"t":"ref","v":"Neh 3:23"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["4. Leader who signed Ezra’s covenant of faithfulness to God with Nehemiah and others after the exile (",{"href":"?bref=Neh.10.23","r":"Neh.10.23","rawR":"Neh.10.23","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Neh.10.23","value":"Neh.10.23"}],"t":"ref","v":"Neh 10:23"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Hasshub","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"1 Chr 9:14","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.9.14","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.9.14","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.9.14"},{"anchorText":"Neh 11:15","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Neh.11.15","rawQueryValue":"Neh.11.15","sourceRefExact":"Neh.11.15"},{"anchorText":"Neh 3:11","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Neh.3.11","rawQueryValue":"Neh.3.11","sourceRefExact":"Neh.3.11"},{"anchorText":"Neh 3:23","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Neh.3.23","rawQueryValue":"Neh.3.23","sourceRefExact":"Neh.3.23"},{"anchorText":"Neh 10:23","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Neh.10.23","rawQueryValue":"Neh.10.23","sourceRefExact":"Neh.10.23"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"10482ad2e5a75c1cd6ea3e37febb29e08c9d32464aade13bb5b67c9bc0027de1","sourceItemName":"Hasshub","sourceItemOrder":153,"sourceMember":"Articles/H.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"Hasshub","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Hasshub","title":"Hasshub","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}